@startuml
[*] --> Initial
Initial --> SettingPreferences : configure preferences
SettingPreferences --> MonitoringEvents : start monitoring
MonitoringEvents --> CheckingCriteria : detect event
CheckingCriteria --> SendingNotification : criteria met
SendingNotification --> LoggingNotification : log notification
LoggingNotification --> MonitoringEvents : continue monitoring
MonitoringEvents --> [*] : stop monitoring
@enduml
